      "reason": "Remainder of the lane ledgers after P2-16 narrowed cluster-registry.json and autorun-queue/needs-{dsl,ruling}.*.jsonl in semantic-scope.mjs pathOverride: autorun-assignments.json (no reader, 0 commits/90d, but prettier checks it), root needs-ruling.jsonl (own content-aware semantic scope) and any new file under autorun-queue/ (a new needs-{dsl,ruling}.<x>.jsonl is the exception: it matches the queue rule and runs docs only, accepted because only lane scripts outside the gates read the queues). Measured 2026-11-02 (確度B): corrupting the six ledgers changed no result of handoff, harness, fidelity, ismcts-program or ismcts-runtime. Narrow the rest with a falsification test, never by deleting this entry."
    },
    {
      "id": "playground-server",
      "patterns": ["^apps/playground-web/server/"],
      "reason": "Room API / local-game server. The 15 modules that exist today are narrowed by exact path in semantic-scope.mjs pathOverride (lists in static-inputs.mjs), so this entry now covers only a file added under server/ later, which keeps the full verification until it is reviewed. Measured 2026-11-02 (確度B): corrupting and deleting all 15 files and running 23 gates (the 28 full gates minus format, lint, types, docs, vitest and secrets, plus card-tests; handoff, ismcts-program, ismcts-runtime, harness, fidelity, auto-merge-integration and 17 more) changed only ssot, through game-api.ts; the merge fuzz summary was identical. The override keeps types, vitest, secrets and docs (a deletion breaks the doc links to game-api.ts and api-limits.ts), plus scenario, local-game-ui, build and public-build for the twelve modules vite.config.ts loads (CI runs those four on a full fallback; chosen by reading imports, not mutated). The unit tests in test-harness.mjs call selectGates without overrides, so their full-selection assertions for server/game-api.ts still hold. Narrow a new file with a falsification test, never by deleting this entry."
    },
    {
      "id": "playground-src",
      "patterns": ["^apps/playground-web/src/"],
      "reason": "Browser app source. The 261 files that no scope claimed on 2026-11-03 are narrowed by exact path (PLAYGROUND_SRC_FILES in static-inputs.mjs, rule in semantic-scope.mjs pathOverride), so this entry now covers only a file added under src/ later (or one a scope no longer claims), which keeps the full verification until it is reviewed. Measured 2026-11-03 (確度B): corrupting and then deleting all 414 files of this entry and of playground-test (261 src, 145 tests, 8 SQL suites) at once and running 24 gates against an unmutated baseline left the heavy script gates unchanged (handoff, ismcts-program, ismcts-runtime, fidelity, auto-merge-integration, effect-debug and 15 more); ssot, docs and harness moved, and a second run over src and tests separately (those three gates only) attributed them: ssot (scans src), docs (a deletion breaks doc links) and harness (the GUI entry-file guard of the server rule), so the override keeps types, vitest, secrets, docs, ssot and harness, plus scenario, local-game-ui, build and public-build (the GUI gates CI runs on a full fallback; chosen by reading, not mutated). The merge fuzz summary was identical (its entry points import none of them), so requiresMergeFuzz exempts the listed files. Narrow a new file with a falsification test, never by deleting this entry."
